客户端(进程A)                         Binder驱动                      服务端(进程B :remote)
─────────────                      ────────────                     ────────────────
Proxy.calculateSum(3,5)
  -> Parcel 写入参数
  -> BinderProxy.transact()
      -> BpBinder::transact()
          -> IPCThreadState::transact()
              write BC_TRANSACTION + handle
              ioctl(BINDER_WRITE_READ)  ──────>
                                                         <─────── Binder线程正在
                                                                   joinThreadPool
                                   驱动查找handle对应节点
                                   挂入目标线程的读取队列
                                   
                                                                 <────── ioctl返回
                                                                       BR_TRANSACTION
                                                                 executeCommand
                                                                   BBinder->transact
                                                                   Stub.onTransact
                                                                     调用calculateSum
                                                                   write reply
                                                                   sendReply BC_REPLY
                                   驱动接收BC_REPLY
              <────── ioctl返回
                 BR_REPLY
         reply->readInt() = 8
  <- 返回8


